  "description": "The private art and design school, Rome University of Fine Arts (RUFA), is located in Rome, at the heart of Italy. RUFA was founded in 1998 to achieve the dreams of its founder, Maestro Alfio Mongelli, as well as those of Italian and international students within a single academy. In addition to visual arts, design, cinema, photography, multimedia, theater, animation, and other fields of the arts, it offers a variety of programs in these areas. As part of its mission to prepare students for professions in the creative industries, RUFA is renowned for its emphasis on practical training and hands-on experience. RUFA offers Bachelor and Master of Arts degree programs that fully respond to current artistic and cultural contexts, offering the best possible training in the arts and solid, immediate job prospects. Therefore, RUFA is an excellent place to study the visual arts, and its reputation is well-deserved. With a strong emphasis on research and a vibrant student life, RUFA is a perfect choice for anyone interested in a career in the visual arts.",
